  "federation_pass_rule": "Every required capability must close for its declared role, every shared invariant must pass, every fixture in the declared denominator must be classified, arithmetic and record conservation must close, and no unresolved residue may remain inside the claimed certification scope. Capabilities marked not_required do not count against a repository."
